# Finite data for the HS stabilizer double-coset cover

The rows describe products of the exact published representatives with powers
of the two normalizer generators. Three slices fix the image of letter 1 at
1, 6, and 13. Packed tables are only computational witnesses: their agreement
with the group elements and the distinctness checks are proved separately.

Source: the ATLAS HSG1-p100B0 permutations retained in this repository;
GLS3 Table 5.3m, p.274, and Aschbacher–Smith p.510 for the application.
The original CFSG generator in `source/generate.py` is untrusted.
-/

@[expose] public section
namespace Sporadic.LeechRelated.HS.SmallIndex.DoubleCosetCertificate

/-- The 55 words used as factors; exhaustiveness in the candidate is unnecessary. -/
def normalWord (i : Fin 55) : CertifiedStabilizer :=
  elevenElement ^ (i.val / 5) * normalizerElement ^ (i.val % 5)

